        "nobel_worthiness": "The first image of a black-hole shadow made an extreme prediction of general relativity directly tangible and opened a new observational route to strong gravity.",
        "attribution": "The listed scientists represent foundational theoretical motivation, global VLBI development and EHT leadership, though the achievement depended on a very large collaboration.",
        "maturity": "The result has been independently extended to another source and rests on a mature observing and analysis programme.",
